# Generated tool state - remembers window position and your place in the sheet.
# Machine-specific, not worth versioning.
CaptionFiller.ini
CaptionFiller2.ini
*.ini

# Excel lock files, created while a workbook is open.
~$*

# Annotation workbooks and exports.
#
# Ignored ON PURPOSE: these hold client annotation data. Keeping them out of
# git means a future "push this to GitHub" can never leak a caption sheet by
# accident. If you ever genuinely want to version one, force it:
#     git add -f "some file.xlsx"
*.xlsx
*.xlsb
*.xls

# Scratch and backup copies.
_TESTCOPY*
*.bak
*.bak-*
